---
description: Use Element Plus components and icons in the desktop GUI renderer
globs: src/renderer/**/*.{vue,ts,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Element Plus only

Prefer Element Plus components. Do not reimplement buttons, dialogs, forms, tables, menus, or notifications.

- Buttons: `el-button`
- Dialogs: `el-dialog`
- Confirms / toasts: `ElMessageBox` / `ElMessage` (see `src/renderer/src/ui.ts`)
- Forms: `el-form`, `el-input`, `el-select`, `el-checkbox`, `el-radio`, `el-date-picker`
- Tables: `el-table`
- Nav: `el-menu`
- Menus: `el-dropdown`
- Tags / chips: `el-tag`

Icons must come from `@element-plus/icons-vue` via `<el-icon><Name /></el-icon>`. Do not hand-write SVG paths or import `@vicons/*`.

```vue
<!-- BAD -->
<button class="primary">保存</button>
<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="..." /></svg>

<!-- GOOD -->
<el-button type="primary">保存</el-button>
<el-icon><Setting /></el-icon>
```
